### DATA ENDPOINT FOR E.g. ADDING A USER
POST http://localhost:3000/api/data
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Khoo"
}
### We want to send the json object 
### We need to configure the parameter of the network request using Content-Type: application/json
### Now, when our server receives this request from this client emulator, it knows it's looking for json
### It can interpret that json and gain access to the value (E.g. "name": "Khoo")